-- החלטת ועדת מעקב מיום 2.11.2022: the follow-up committee of the wage
-- agreement of 19.10.2022, deciding under its §35. The agreement was signed
-- on 19.10.2022 (its title's 19.9.2022 is a scribal error); its annex ה —
-- the pay, as substitution hours, of a teacher who escorts a trip on his
-- free day or on a day he is placed for fewer than 7 hours — was left out by
-- oversight and is attached here; it has no annex ד; and the vacation days
-- of its §29 turn on the placement over the school year, not on the share
-- of a position, the words "in a full position" in 29.1 having been left in
-- by oversight.
--
-- It imports the agreement's module: annex ה is the named input of the
-- agreement's §13.1.3 (`the annex that pays escorting on a free or short
-- day`), and its §29 reading is the agreement's own rule. The pay of a
-- substitution hour is the base agreement's §29, on §31's hour value, both
-- imported. The trips agreement of 8.9.1998 is not in the corpus.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `2022-10-19_ofek-hadash_wage-agreement`
IMPORT `base-agreement-29`
IMPORT `base-agreement-31`

§ `החלטת ועדת המעקב מיום 2.11.2022`

-- akn:preamble The decision's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The decision's title; no rule.

-- The committee of §35 of the agreement of 19.10.2022 met on 2.11.2022 and
-- decided as follows: its decision binds the parties finally (§35,
-- imported).
@ref akn:preamble/p2
`the follow-up committee met on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 2 11 2022

#ASSERT `what binds the parties in a dispute` "the decision of 2.11.2022" "a party's other reading" EQUALS "the decision of 2.11.2022"

-- 1: the agreement was signed on 19.10.2022; the title's 19.9.2022 is a
-- scribal error. The day is the agreement's, from which its §§1–35 run.
@ref akn:art_1
`the wage agreement of 2022 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 19 10 2022
`the day the wage agreement's title printed` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 19 9 2022

#ASSERT `in the agreement's period` `the wage agreement of 2022 was signed on`
#ASSERT NOT `a labour dispute the union declared stands` `the wage agreement of 2022 was signed on`

-- 2: annex ה, "the pay, on the basis of substitution hours, for a teaching
-- employee who escorts trips on his free day or on a day he is employed
-- for fewer than 7 hours", was left out of the agreement by oversight; it
-- is attached to this decision as an inseparable part of it (below). ¶2:
-- the agreement has no annex ד.
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p2
`the annexes of the wage agreement of 2022` MEANS LIST "א", "ב", "ג", "ה"

#ASSERT NOT elem "ד" `the annexes of the wage agreement of 2022`
-- Annex ה is the one §13.1.3 makes pay escorting from 1.9.2023.
#ASSERT `the annex that pays escorting on a free or short day` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023) EQUALS `annex ה of this agreement`

-- 3: the vacation days of §29 do not turn on the share of a position but on
-- the placement over the school year (§29 and the Director-General's letter
-- of 19.10.22); "in a full position" in 29.1 bears on nobody's right and was
-- left there by oversight. This is the reading the agreement's encoding
-- already takes (F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-h; convention precedence.specific):
-- `the vacation days for the school year`, imported, asks the placement
-- only. The decision settles it.
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN t IS A `vacation-day teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the vacation days for the school year, as the decision of 2.11.2022 reads §29` t IS
    `the vacation days for the school year` t

`a teacher at half a position placed for the whole year` MEANS
    `vacation-day teacher` WITH
        `placed for a full school year`  IS TRUE
        `placed in a full position`      IS FALSE
        `must work on 13 Adar or the first day of the winter vacation` IS FALSE
        `must work on 18 Iyar or the first day of the spring vacation` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `the vacation days for the school year, as the decision of 2.11.2022 reads §29` `a teacher at half a position placed for the whole year` EQUALS 2

DECLARE `registration action` IS ONE OF
    `submit the decision of 2.11.2022 for registration with the agreement of 19.10.2022`

-- 4: the decision is submitted for registration with the agreement. No day
-- is set (convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_4
`registering the decision of 2.11.2022` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `submit the decision of 2.11.2022 for registration with the agreement of 19.10.2022`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The signatures and posts of the wages commissioner, the Director-General and the union's secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:attachments The annexes: a label row with no text of its own.

§§ `נספח ה' — התגמול המשולם, על בסיס שעות מילוי מקום, לעובד הוראה המלווה טיולים ביום החופשי שלו או ביום בו הוא מועסק פחות מ־7 שעות`

-- The annex's title says whom it is for: a teaching employee who escorts
-- trips on his free day, or on a day he is employed for fewer than 7 hours.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1
GIVEN `hours he is placed for that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `annex ה is for an escort placed for` `hours he is placed for that day` IF
    `hours he is placed for that day` LESS THAN 7

-- The rows: placed for 0 hours that day (a free day), 7 hours or the
-- activity's hours, the lower; for 1, 6; 2, 5; 3, 4; 4, 3; 5, 2; 6, 1; for 7
-- and more, 0 — each "or the activity's hours, the lower". The rule they
-- print: 7 less the hours placed, never below 0, and never more than the
-- activity's hours.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p6 akn:att_1__hc_1/p7 akn:att_1__hc_1/p8 akn:att_1__hc_1/p9
GIVEN `hours he is placed for that day` IS A NUMBER, `hours of the activity` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the substitution hours annex ה pays` `hours he is placed for that day` `hours of the activity` IS
    min (max (7 MINUS `hours he is placed for that day`) 0) `hours of the activity`

-- The rows as the annex prints them: hours placed, and hours paid when the
-- activity is long enough.
`annex ה's printed rows` MEANS
    LIST (LIST 0, 7), (LIST 1, 6), (LIST 2, 5), (LIST 3, 4), (LIST 4, 3), (LIST 5, 2), (LIST 6, 1), (LIST 7, 0)

GIVEN r IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the placed hours of an annex ה row` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN h FOLLOWED BY rest THEN h
    WHEN EMPTY THEN 0

GIVEN r IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the paid hours of an annex ה row` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN h FOLLOWED BY rest THEN `the placed hours of an annex ה row` rest
    WHEN EMPTY THEN 0

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD `the substitution hours annex ה pays` (`the placed hours of an annex ה row` r) 10 EQUALS `the paid hours of an annex ה row` r) `annex ה's printed rows`
-- "7 and more": a day of 9 placed hours pays none.
#ASSERT `the substitution hours annex ה pays` 9 10 EQUALS 0
-- A free day with an activity of 4 hours: the 4.
#ASSERT `the substitution hours annex ה pays` 0 4 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `annex ה is for an escort placed for` 6
#ASSERT NOT `annex ה is for an escort placed for` 7

-- The pay is those hours as substitution hours (§29 of the base agreement,
-- imported): on his free day, §29(ג)'s; on a day he is placed for some
-- hours, a substitution hour not in place of a stay hour, §29(ב)'s — 125%
-- of §31's hour value either way.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1
GIVEN `hours he is placed for that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `when the substitution hour is done`
DECIDE `the kind of substitution hour annex ה pays` `hours he is placed for that day` IS
    IF `hours he is placed for that day` EQUALS 0
    THEN `on the teacher's free day`
    ELSE `on a working day, not in place of a stay hour`

GIVEN `hours he is placed for that day` IS A NUMBER, `hours of the activity` IS A NUMBER, p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the escort pay under annex ה` `hours he is placed for that day` `hours of the activity` p IS
    `the substitution hours annex ה pays` `hours he is placed for that day` `hours of the activity` TIMES `pay for a substitution hour` (`the kind of substitution hour annex ה pays` `hours he is placed for that day`) p

-- The base agreement's placeholder teacher, 50 an hour: two hours placed,
-- an activity of 8, five substitution hours at 62.5.
#ASSERT `the escort pay under annex ה` 2 8 `a teacher for the hour value` EQUALS 312.5

-- Where the activity's actual hours are fewer than the hours he is placed
-- for that day, no hours are taken off his salary.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p10
GIVEN `hours he is placed for that day` IS A NUMBER, `hours of the activity` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours taken off his salary for an escort day` `hours he is placed for that day` `hours of the activity` IS
    0

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p11 A note that the page is initialled in its margin; no rule.
